    "summary": "Toy cradle, leather, sewn round a carved wood form, the edges decorated with bands of felted wool in red and yellow with red and blue wool tassels and a plaited wool cord at the top end, the bands riveted on with brass rivets. The cradel fastened with two leather flaps with leather loops for a cord (missing) and a piece of printed red and white cotton cloth sewn round the edge of the hood covering the whole cradle. Inside, a baby with painted porcelain head, with a shawl of the same printed cotton cloth, rests on a pillow of padded cotton cloth. A string of orange-coloured beads hangs from the hood.",
